1. P-K4 or 1.e4 in algebraic. (JboPre tend to prefer this opening
because it has the highest percentage of White victories; should
the statistics change, they would all immediately begin playing
something else.)(Klingons, on the other hand, like violent openings
such as "The Spike" 1.P-KN4 (1.g4), & the "Klingon Gambit" 1.P-QB4
P-QN4 (1.c4 b5) which, although received with derision on Terra, is
still found in Klingon coffeehouses the galaxy over.
